    },
    "body": "Existing cue/prefix fits update angular tables at hard addresses but omit credit to the independently encoded natural query/assertion roots. Connect the existing three root families to full native bank cue→prefix→SourceEnd answer/EOS alias loss using exact hard forward and an offline finite H4-choice adjoint. Freeze transitions/categories/donor payloads and honestly rebind updated native exports.\n\nAdd a dedicated source-only observation admission/fit driver with original-utterance/BPE/stored-record provenance, all admitted candidates, root-only filtering before clipping, baseline-inclusive selection, honest seed scope, and measured zero-update B8 cost admission before explicitly configured AdamW. Legacy bank helper changes are narrow visibility only.\n\nActual CPU validation:2 cue tests and4 intended realizer tests PASS at8e57b8d6 (+2 incidental historical); final driver22 tests PASS at34592d9a (2 new/20 reused). Library source is byte-identical at the final head. Complete committed-source SHA inventories verified. Initial zero-matched realizer command is excluded; two storage-interrupted compiles and repaired driver compile defects are retained. No natural panel/actual-parent gradient admission/fit/fresh recall or optimized main build ran. Source/static reviewers approve this implementation scope only. Final documentation changes no numerical source; claim wording passes.\n\nThe next task is the separately drafted Rust natural-panel preparer, actual-parent zero-update gradient/descriptor/cost admission, then prospective seeded fitting. References #820, #1552. Shared session unchanged; no learned attention/chat or energy advantage claim.\n",
